  "extractionVersion": 9,
  "sourceUpdatedAt": null,
  "sourceHash": "9508ad2f207ca67b204789c2951c31c9484c2fe6d058030a9081dd06a0dabf7d",
  "translatedAt": "2026-08-31T05:23:54.424Z",
  "title": "Extending the Event Fast-Forward Function [RPG Maker MZ & MV Plugin]",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "title",
      "type": "title",
      "source": "イベント高速化機能を拡張【RPGツクールMZ&MVプラグイン】",
      "sourceHash": "df66e8d88be2a58d3ae9588920487364661f6a96c7a2afd34b1cb2ab4ef74781",
      "translation": "Extending the Event Fast-Forward Function [RPG Maker MZ & MV Plugin]",
      "contextHash": "df66e8d88be2a58d3ae9588920487364661f6a96c7a2afd34b1cb2ab4ef74781"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-001",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "ツクールＭＶ～ＭＺにはイベント実行中に、決定キーを押しっぱなしにすると動作が倍速化する機能があります。",
      "sourceHash": "fc0f9d1044137e664ddeaba9570f3f94801a39e2a63f26fdb8a2e956dc143f1c",
      "translation": "In RPG Maker MV–MZ, holding down the Confirm key while an event is running speeds up its execution.",
      "contextHash": "fc0f9d1044137e664ddeaba9570f3f94801a39e2a63f26fdb8a2e956dc143f1c"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-002",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "それなりに便利ではありますが、標準で強制的に付いているため融通が利きません。",
      "sourceHash": "287ed99ddf1020071664a2b66d0a1cdd44cf2a12af0ef0ed7ca62b302430c0fc",
      "translation": "This is fairly convenient, but since it is forcibly enabled by default, it lacks flexibility.",
      "contextHash": "287ed99ddf1020071664a2b66d0a1cdd44cf2a12af0ef0ed7ca62b302430c0fc"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-003",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "そこでいくつかの拡張を行います。",
      "sourceHash": "ff319b497f21ab03d1c89a4eff83badd3ff19a0886b9918e70df8dfca17cf46d",
      "translation": "So, I made several extensions.",
      "contextHash": "ff319b497f21ab03d1c89a4eff83badd3ff19a0886b9918e70df8dfca17cf46d"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-004",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "上記は８倍速でイベントを実行した例です。",
      "sourceHash": "d8a609296d1e803d9f2d1035a483f70ef71bb1d4bfb3c7b760de15e8f7102579",
      "translation": "The example above shows an event running at eight times the normal speed.",
      "contextHash": "d8a609296d1e803d9f2d1035a483f70ef71bb1d4bfb3c7b760de15e8f7102579"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-005",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "この機能によって、一度見たイベントをスキップできるようにしておくと親切です。開発テスト時も余計なイベントを飛ばせるので便利！",
      "sourceHash": "00bddfb5c5487a74c005e6340c31d68e1e2849065d4bace4346a18dad9dbecff",
      "translation": "It is helpful to use this function to allow events you have already seen to be skipped. It is also convenient during development testing, since you can skip unnecessary events!",
      "contextHash": "00bddfb5c5487a74c005e6340c31d68e1e2849065d4bace4346a18dad9dbecff"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-001",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "主な機能",
      "sourceHash": "c38e630d348b526e176f6cfd8a4c185e06c0a28dde73c13226a6074d2f726c42",
      "translation": "Main Features",
      "contextHash": "c38e630d348b526e176f6cfd8a4c185e06c0a28dde73c13226a6074d2f726c42"
    },
    {
      "id": "list-001",
      "type": "list",
      "source": "描画処理（アニメーション、フキダシなど）の高速化",
      "sourceHash": "8e66ea1f9b06619ebab63a2a6011382ffcc4ed3711c71e4cb5e87a22c3b242f0",
      "translation": "Faster rendering (animations, balloon icons, etc.)",
      "contextHash": "8e66ea1f9b06619ebab63a2a6011382ffcc4ed3711c71e4cb5e87a22c3b242f0"
    },
    {
      "id": "list-002",
      "type": "list",
      "source": "使用するキーの変更",
      "sourceHash": "dcca1bc777d676b703b5c926dfdaeafe04a460fea4127f66998fd4cacd04d94d",
      "translation": "Change the key used",
      "contextHash": "dcca1bc777d676b703b5c926dfdaeafe04a460fea4127f66998fd4cacd04d94d"
    },
    {
      "id": "list-003",
      "type": "list",
      "source": "実行速度の変更",
      "sourceHash": "ad43a66f1a167eeec3d1f5ce63454b8517217fb674a83f40a310174690333632",
      "translation": "Change the execution speed",
      "contextHash": "ad43a66f1a167eeec3d1f5ce63454b8517217fb674a83f40a310174690333632"
    },
    {
      "id": "list-004",
      "type": "list",
      "source": "実行までの押しっぱなし時間の変更",
      "sourceHash": "10f05eb3b763f80932cadfd58adc856fd033f1f0be94a738ac3d4ce8e11e8f38",
      "translation": "Change how long the key must be held before execution begins",
      "contextHash": "10f05eb3b763f80932cadfd58adc856fd033f1f0be94a738ac3d4ce8e11e8f38"
    },
    {
      "id": "list-005",
      "type": "list",
      "source": "タッチＵＩ側の設定も別途指定可",
      "sourceHash": "44c3bd68b81b831dbc096acd4f39f276d79620ffb402d6f1aa5171fc2071702f",
      "translation": "Touch UI settings can also be specified separately",
      "contextHash": "44c3bd68b81b831dbc096acd4f39f276d79620ffb402d6f1aa5171fc2071702f"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-006",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "このプラグインにはメッセージを高速化する機能はありませんが、既存のメッセージ高速化プラグインと併用できます。例えば、メッセージスキップ系のプラグインとキーを合わせることで、イベント全体を高速化することも可能です。",
      "sourceHash": "ab79eb96c757acc0438d4c6201107c3eff4086d86930bb80282da575dd2792b8",
      "translation": "This plugin does not include a function for speeding up messages, but it can be used together with existing message fast-forward plugins. For example, by assigning it the same key as a message-skipping plugin, you can speed up the entire event.",
      "contextHash": "ab79eb96c757acc0438d4c6201107c3eff4086d86930bb80282da575dd2792b8"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-002",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "目次",
      "sourceHash": "6763aa62211b44a20c71505eed18421683192c2f2f37668012e8aaa008367120",
      "translation": "Table of Contents",
      "contextHash": "6763aa62211b44a20c71505eed18421683192c2f2f37668012e8aaa008367120"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-003",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "導入方法（install）",
      "sourceHash": "a74eebb051e898173751a501ebea136f6891e7f24c5dc00722bd5bd693d13275",
      "translation": "Installation (install)",
      "contextHash": "a74eebb051e898173751a501ebea136f6891e7f24c5dc00722bd5bd693d13275"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-007",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "以下のファイルを右クリックで保存し 、[プロジェクト]\\js\\plugins に放り込みます。ツクールのプラグイン管理から機能をONにしてください。",
      "sourceHash": "7f5880d732c954e0e725bc277f22b64c316416f8cec8a7b7a0622deed1c8217a",
      "translation": "Right-click the file below to save it, then place it in [Project]\\js\\plugins. Turn the feature ON in the plugin manager in RPG Maker.",
      "contextHash": "7f5880d732c954e0e725bc277f22b64c316416f8cec8a7b7a0622deed1c8217a"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-008",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "※このプラグインはＭＶ、ＭＺの両方で有効です。",
      "sourceHash": "340f20fc141f77062a4b651d80f5fa9579a7f4f61e9d652070241707a1e11ad5",
      "translation": "※This plugin works with both MV and MZ.",
      "contextHash": "340f20fc141f77062a4b651d80f5fa9579a7f4f61e9d652070241707a1e11ad5"
    },
    {
      "id": "link-001",
      "type": "link",
      "source": "NRP_EventFastForward.js",
      "sourceHash": "9439702ca18a89dbc539bc1eb78678ed14426b7e6fdc341cb3c29935dc8bbf7a",
      "translation": "NRP_EventFastForward.js ",
      "contextHash": "90f21924696453defc360c7405718013114ff3389cf9121277b9af0e02cd0da3"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-009",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "ver1.02（2024/01/20）",
      "sourceHash": "c4670df50019974b8e6a38ae168aee360983384d6818c2c5fc9492c08b973115",
      "translation": "ver1.02 (2024/01/20) ",
      "contextHash": "90f21924696453defc360c7405718013114ff3389cf9121277b9af0e02cd0da3"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-004",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "更新履歴（History）",
      "sourceHash": "5f6734086058838026416575c635cfc7e1074ad8b8757438df171ba1ac7963c7",
      "translation": "Update History (History)",
      "contextHash": "5f6734086058838026416575c635cfc7e1074ad8b8757438df171ba1ac7963c7"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-005",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "2024/01/20（ver1.02）",
      "sourceHash": "0961e33a00f9f61220b27deb89cb296caab82c03ed5ae14810f030f5981def7d",
      "translation": "2024/01/20 (ver1.02) ",
      "contextHash": "0961e33a00f9f61220b27deb89cb296caab82c03ed5ae14810f030f5981def7d"
    },
    {
      "id": "list-006",
      "type": "list",
      "source": "※ツクールMZ1.8の更新にて、高速化キーを押しっぱなしにした際にメッセージウェイトを飛ばすようになりましたが、それを無効化するための機能です。",
      "sourceHash": "46571af19ce45772bcac936997144333e7b59e1c4457639b2027e10b7931d32d",
      "translation": "※RPG Maker MZ1.8 introduced behavior that skips message waits when the fast-forward key is held down. This function disables that behavior.",
      "contextHash": "46571af19ce45772bcac936997144333e7b59e1c4457639b2027e10b7931d32d"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-006",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "2022/02/11（ver1.01）",
      "sourceHash": "3f129ffeb069b3e240d6fb96f7bef1e65535b76e9489ee7251016c8aeefcec60",
      "translation": "2022/02/11 (ver1.01) ",
      "contextHash": "3f129ffeb069b3e240d6fb96f7bef1e65535b76e9489ee7251016c8aeefcec60"
    },
    {
      "id": "list-007",
      "type": "list",
      "source": "アニメーションやフキダシも高速化が可能になります。",
      "sourceHash": "d62980cfcd49276dfdc6a991fa4b8a2c2c5229beaae60c4cdb83146d94cb91cd",
      "translation": "Animations and balloon icons can now also be sped up.",
      "contextHash": "d62980cfcd49276dfdc6a991fa4b8a2c2c5229beaae60c4cdb83146d94cb91cd"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-007",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "2021/10/09（ver1.00）",
      "sourceHash": "496cb415f5cc582ccd3d04409caf03d00195ae308bbac0b04d297709614cd5a0",
      "translation": "2021/10/09 (ver1.00) ",
      "contextHash": "496cb415f5cc582ccd3d04409caf03d00195ae308bbac0b04d297709614cd5a0"
    },
    {
      "id": "list-008",
      "type": "list",
      "source": "公開！",
      "sourceHash": "db16b64ccc528b64a0ff8adf39553bdd72ca60eb32c274c6a2d0185b3be59664",
      "translation": "Released!",
      "contextHash": "db16b64ccc528b64a0ff8adf39553bdd72ca60eb32c274c6a2d0185b3be59664"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-008",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "プラグインパラメータ（Plugin Parameter）",
      "sourceHash": "f4b540e9f0397a1265e0ce8b0574e8fade43b17d30f049312ef0f2eb5efd4805",
      "translation": "Plugin Parameters (Plugin Parameter)",
      "contextHash": "f4b540e9f0397a1265e0ce8b0574e8fade43b17d30f049312ef0f2eb5efd4805"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-009",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "高速化キー（FastKey）",
      "sourceHash": "302e5614f7d86f7b2e045b5737035891a6b3268a6bd017b95d34c4f06a3b858e",
      "translation": "Fast-Forward Key (FastKey)",
      "contextHash": "302e5614f7d86f7b2e045b5737035891a6b3268a6bd017b95d34c4f06a3b858e"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-010",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "イベント高速化を実行するキーです。",
      "sourceHash": "8619723a7832081c1b9f0de48b1a416f217777937e4616463c80e508704718d1",
      "translation": "This is the key used to activate event fast-forwarding.",
      "contextHash": "8619723a7832081c1b9f0de48b1a416f217777937e4616463c80e508704718d1"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-011",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "候補から選択してください。",
      "sourceHash": "fb9e55f2ddff959211592263e7e89fe34406919de14f965c5aca24c9f2dff992",
      "translation": "Please select one from the available options.",
      "contextHash": "fb9e55f2ddff959211592263e7e89fe34406919de14f965c5aca24c9f2dff992"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-010",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "速度倍率（SpeedMultiply）",
      "sourceHash": "5389318dfe0a7a3d34739b8655096046c2e79b77bcf007a1994fa77648c4f0a2",
      "translation": "Speed Multiplier (SpeedMultiply)",
      "contextHash": "5389318dfe0a7a3d34739b8655096046c2e79b77bcf007a1994fa77648c4f0a2"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-012",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "高速化時のイベント速度の倍率です。",
      "sourceHash": "cd089d034e87dee37774d0298e794127878d161f9b6bc55f05ca27a44728a0d4",
      "translation": "This is the event speed multiplier when fast-forwarding.",
      "contextHash": "cd089d034e87dee37774d0298e794127878d161f9b6bc55f05ca27a44728a0d4"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-013",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "1以下なら高速化は無効になります。",
      "sourceHash": "a0d165fe3ad2bd72ebbf5aef2463f2a24208037141ebf89361e734fc1121b441",
      "translation": "Fast-forwarding is disabled if the value is 1 or lower.",
      "contextHash": "a0d165fe3ad2bd72ebbf5aef2463f2a24208037141ebf89361e734fc1121b441"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-014",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "※あまり倍率が高すぎると処理落ちしたりするので、ご注意ください。",
      "sourceHash": "b7d4d590b4d4b6b05f32324f0c8a5556ade866b082d7f79d686e81bcc5c9d307",
      "translation": "※Please note that excessively high multipliers may cause processing slowdowns.",
      "contextHash": "b7d4d590b4d4b6b05f32324f0c8a5556ade866b082d7f79d686e81bcc5c9d307"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-011",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "速度倍率の変数（SpeedVariableId）",
      "sourceHash": "3d8d9a8ef15f6698dcc562213fec35e76eed371df26cf41968030bba6daa53ff",
      "translation": "Speed Multiplier Variable (SpeedVariableId)",
      "contextHash": "3d8d9a8ef15f6698dcc562213fec35e76eed371df26cf41968030bba6daa53ff"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-015",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "イベント高速化の倍率を設定する変数です。",
      "sourceHash": "9147f9b31a9c82dd4e2f4e208607e489bea0cee0ab4e3b2b71a9c4f50f8e1823",
      "translation": "This variable sets the event fast-forward multiplier.",
      "contextHash": "9147f9b31a9c82dd4e2f4e208607e489bea0cee0ab4e3b2b71a9c4f50f8e1823"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-016",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "値が1以下なら高速化無効。速度倍率より優先されます。",
      "sourceHash": "64041e656b0550529123ded4f507b862849cc9baac6bd847230a1843f3968820",
      "translation": "Fast-forwarding is disabled if the value is 1 or lower. This takes priority over the speed multiplier.",
      "contextHash": "64041e656b0550529123ded4f507b862849cc9baac6bd847230a1843f3968820"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-012",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "開始プレス時間（PressWait）",
      "sourceHash": "8bba2ec3b409641901ed56a1e670072d0830446a1503fefa3cb5c1d1b4ff6f17",
      "translation": "Press Start Wait (PressWait)",
      "contextHash": "8bba2ec3b409641901ed56a1e670072d0830446a1503fefa3cb5c1d1b4ff6f17"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-017",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "キーを押し始めてから、高速化を開始するまでの所要時間です。",
      "sourceHash": "7ee98235010daef8785e9ccb02f3bda06327f37bc2a303f508edeed05f42108b",
      "translation": "This is the amount of time from when the key starts being pressed until fast-forwarding begins.",
      "contextHash": "7ee98235010daef8785e9ccb02f3bda06327f37bc2a303f508edeed05f42108b"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-018",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "1/60秒単位で指定してください。",
      "sourceHash": "0d67a437c43218dafbd38a85ac2d8658470c0d691f5807c709bb3fe68f22a0f2",
      "translation": "Specify the value in units of 1/60 of a second.",
      "contextHash": "0d67a437c43218dafbd38a85ac2d8658470c0d691f5807c709bb3fe68f22a0f2"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-013",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "描画処理を高速化（FastSprite）",
      "sourceHash": "ee85efe80c9503fc4ce9aaff7324fa522c2e0502cb8cf8fd5b23b8f50370b0e1",
      "translation": "Speed Up Rendering (FastSprite)",
      "contextHash": "ee85efe80c9503fc4ce9aaff7324fa522c2e0502cb8cf8fd5b23b8f50370b0e1"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-019",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "描画処理を高速化します。",
      "sourceHash": "743215556615b6bf70353c69269646e76d3e373604d0a8f6c9122580ed48f5f7",
      "translation": "Speeds up rendering.",
      "contextHash": "743215556615b6bf70353c69269646e76d3e373604d0a8f6c9122580ed48f5f7"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-020",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "アニメーションやフキダシなども高速化されます。",
      "sourceHash": "b4834c78d636ba5317f91d703a210c5b6f4702693b9b6f1c19e7bab7e22953f4",
      "translation": "Animations and balloon icons are also sped up.",
      "contextHash": "b4834c78d636ba5317f91d703a210c5b6f4702693b9b6f1c19e7bab7e22953f4"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-014",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "メッセージウェイトを有効化（NotCancelMessageWait）",
      "sourceHash": "9f4b9b8c793dacc04f8cc8bc01b7acd62901f22c5d98e704d3b9168b35fd8d7f",
      "translation": "Enable Message Waits (NotCancelMessageWait)",
      "contextHash": "9f4b9b8c793dacc04f8cc8bc01b7acd62901f22c5d98e704d3b9168b35fd8d7f"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-021",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "高速化時にメッセージウェイトを無効化しないようにします。",
      "sourceHash": "db2b769fcf526f675a7459404b982f86f4388ccfd1da0e179076aa98d4cc00c8",
      "translation": "Prevents message waits from being disabled during fast-forwarding.",
      "contextHash": "db2b769fcf526f675a7459404b982f86f4388ccfd1da0e179076aa98d4cc00c8"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-022",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "※ツクールMZ1.8の更新にて、高速化キーを押しっぱなしにした際にメッセージウェイトを飛ばすようになりました。",
      "sourceHash": "c8b007a70fcbd3bd7860ea1fb658bd65d7e5222cf947b03184d8a32ff1bb7591",
      "translation": "※RPG Maker MZ1.8 introduced behavior that skips message waits when the fast-forward key is held down.",
      "contextHash": "c8b007a70fcbd3bd7860ea1fb658bd65d7e5222cf947b03184d8a32ff1bb7591"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-023",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "しかしながら、それまでのバージョンとはイベントのタイミングがズレるため、不具合が起こる可能性があります。MZ1.7までの挙動に戻すことでそれに対処できます。",
      "sourceHash": "b3c6542d34cf6c5af69c518f08a1507b4f98ca625c5dd40a01368b80670ab806",
      "translation": "However, this shifts event timing compared to earlier versions and may cause problems. You can address this by restoring the behavior from MZ1.7 and earlier.",
      "contextHash": "b3c6542d34cf6c5af69c518f08a1507b4f98ca625c5dd40a01368b80670ab806"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-015",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "タッチ関連のプラグインパラメータ（Touch）",
      "sourceHash": "1c89a8f6f8b6a6fda4d71d071200c63b24767c09fc97a30c689c82680c27d006",
      "translation": "Touch-Related Plugin Parameters (Touch)",
      "contextHash": "1c89a8f6f8b6a6fda4d71d071200c63b24767c09fc97a30c689c82680c27d006"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-024",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "以下はタッチ操作時のイベント高速化設定です。",
      "sourceHash": "0063ce2d396d64c9917c00bbe3778e3dd1a9b8c5f915b15bb82a99516e844067",
      "translation": "The following are the event fast-forward settings for touch operation.",
      "contextHash": "0063ce2d396d64c9917c00bbe3778e3dd1a9b8c5f915b15bb82a99516e844067"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-025",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "特に指定しなければ、上記と同じ設定を使用します。",
      "sourceHash": "a3588cacdd1e1691e47c072e8e2e12efee9371b29281b205032369f935e96286",
      "translation": "Unless specified otherwise, the same settings as above are used.",
      "contextHash": "a3588cacdd1e1691e47c072e8e2e12efee9371b29281b205032369f935e96286"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-016",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "速度倍率（タッチ）（TouchSpeedMultiply）",
      "sourceHash": "4225d96597efd82db2ffd4f71c4c883b42e9b5fbd320d9ebe3d2703a93f5585c",
      "translation": "Speed Multiplier (Touch) (TouchSpeedMultiply)",
      "contextHash": "4225d96597efd82db2ffd4f71c4c883b42e9b5fbd320d9ebe3d2703a93f5585c"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-026",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "高速化時のイベント速度の倍率です。",
      "sourceHash": "cd089d034e87dee37774d0298e794127878d161f9b6bc55f05ca27a44728a0d4",
      "translation": "This is the event speed multiplier when fast-forwarding.",
      "contextHash": "cd089d034e87dee37774d0298e794127878d161f9b6bc55f05ca27a44728a0d4"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-027",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "1以下なら高速化は無効になります。",
      "sourceHash": "a0d165fe3ad2bd72ebbf5aef2463f2a24208037141ebf89361e734fc1121b441",
      "translation": "Fast-forwarding is disabled if the value is 1 or lower.",
      "contextHash": "a0d165fe3ad2bd72ebbf5aef2463f2a24208037141ebf89361e734fc1121b441"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-017",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "速度倍率の変数（タッチ）（TouchSpeedVariableId）",
      "sourceHash": "ae7aa2f4851ad00fe970fece30beb81a60b1da341d0e8ce8256fd34d8ff6346b",
      "translation": "Speed Multiplier Variable (Touch) (TouchSpeedVariableId)",
      "contextHash": "ae7aa2f4851ad00fe970fece30beb81a60b1da341d0e8ce8256fd34d8ff6346b"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-028",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "イベント高速化の倍率を設定する変数です。",
      "sourceHash": "9147f9b31a9c82dd4e2f4e208607e489bea0cee0ab4e3b2b71a9c4f50f8e1823",
      "translation": "This variable sets the event fast-forward multiplier.",
      "contextHash": "9147f9b31a9c82dd4e2f4e208607e489bea0cee0ab4e3b2b71a9c4f50f8e1823"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-029",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "値が1以下なら高速化無効。速度倍率より優先されます。",
      "sourceHash": "64041e656b0550529123ded4f507b862849cc9baac6bd847230a1843f3968820",
      "translation": "Speed-up is disabled if the value is 1 or lower. This takes priority over the speed multiplier.",
      "contextHash": "64041e656b0550529123ded4f507b862849cc9baac6bd847230a1843f3968820"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-018",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "開始プレス時間（タッチ）（TouchPressWait）",
      "sourceHash": "fa647d864a78db6b66b73230b4d0dd5188b557b14d015cd2af17327b30b9738e",
      "translation": "Initial Press Duration (Touch) (TouchPressWait)",
      "contextHash": "fa647d864a78db6b66b73230b4d0dd5188b557b14d015cd2af17327b30b9738e"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-030",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "キーを押し始めてから、高速化を開始するまでの所要時間です。",
      "sourceHash": "7ee98235010daef8785e9ccb02f3bda06327f37bc2a303f508edeed05f42108b",
      "translation": "The time required from when the key is first pressed until speed-up begins.",
      "contextHash": "7ee98235010daef8785e9ccb02f3bda06327f37bc2a303f508edeed05f42108b"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-031",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "1/60秒単位で指定してください。",
      "sourceHash": "0d67a437c43218dafbd38a85ac2d8658470c0d691f5807c709bb3fe68f22a0f2",
      "translation": "Specify this in 1/60-second increments.",
      "contextHash": "0d67a437c43218dafbd38a85ac2d8658470c0d691f5807c709bb3fe68f22a0f2"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-019",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "謝辞（Acknowledgements）",
      "sourceHash": "b861d353db7fdca6d86d712a2c622c0d6168ecd3841800dda0786e91a80e5d1a",
      "translation": "Acknowledgements (Acknowledgements)",
      "contextHash": "b861d353db7fdca6d86d712a2c622c0d6168ecd3841800dda0786e91a80e5d1a"
    }
  ],
